# Content pipeline (MD → JSON)

## Sources (whitelist, project root)

| MD | Route |
|----|-------|
| `main.md` | `/` (home sections) |
| `faq.md` | `/faq` |
| `terms.md` | `/terms` |
| `privacy.md` | `/privacy` |

`README.md`, `figma-plugin-export-tokens/README.md`, and `example/` are **not** parsed.

## Workflow

1. Edit the relevant `*.md` in the project root.
2. Run `npm run sync:content`.
3. Commit both MD and generated `src/app/data/*.json`.

**Do not** hand-edit `src/app/data/*.json` — they are generated.

## Output layout

```
src/app/data/siteMeta.json
src/app/data/dataCasinoInfo.json       ← intro + About Our Platform
src/app/data/dataRegistration.json     ← Registration & Login
src/app/data/dataTransactions.json
src/app/data/dataMobileGaming.json
src/app/data/dataGames.json
src/app/data/dataLanguageCurrency.json
src/app/data/dataBonuses.json
src/app/data/dataInfoAfterSupport.json ← Pros & Cons
src/app/data/dataFaq.json
src/app/data/dataFooter.json
src/app/data/siteUi.json
src/app/data/pages/{slug}.json
```

## Language

Site language is fixed `en-GB` (`<html lang="en-GB">`, `openGraph.locale: en_GB`). No locale/geo routing.

## Page layouts (`StaticRichPage`)

| variant | Pages | Blocks |
|---------|-------|--------|
| `footer-legal` | terms, privacy | BonusSection → H1 → h2 → intro → sections |
| `footer-faq` | faq | BonusSection → H1 → h2 → intro → FaqAccordionList |

Home page h1 lives in `BonusSection` (from `siteMeta.h1`), not `H1Section`.
